# Rattleback Apothecary: "Deathtouch. Whenever you commit a crime, target creature you control gains your choice of menace or
# lifelink until end of turn." On turn one Bot1 casts it with Black Lotus and Grizzly Bears with two Moxen. On turn three a Shock
# at Bot1's own face is no crime (nothing goes on the stack beside it); a Shock at Bot2 is (CR 700.13): the trigger's target
# refuses Bot2's Memnite (it must be a creature you control) and takes the Bears, which gain menace (CR 608.2d, 611.2a,
# 702.111) and not lifelink; the Apothecary keeps just deathtouch. On Bot2's turn four the Bears have lost it.

